WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.760
Hey, remember me?

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.020
I was just wondering if you wanted to get maybe... dinner?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.640
I don't know about you, but I love seafood.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.000
There's a place on Wilshire

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.940
Well, we could... tonight?

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.720
Holly, right?

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.460
Holly Garling

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.080
Yes, Eric?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.200
Hey Babe

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.040
I'm serious though Hol,

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.200
move on already!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.620
Someone's popular

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.420
Who's the guy?

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.140
I already... Sorta have a boyfriend, so-

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.520
No you don't.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.740
*Screams*

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.460
*Water drips*

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:13.640
All these people who talk about love like it's this... lightning bolt.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.940
Loves not a lightning bolt.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.500
Real love... takes work.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:23.020
Are you really going to lecture me on love? You're keeping a girl in a cage.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.000
I'm not doing this for me,

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.960
I'm doing this for you

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:32.220
No! Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.540
You just have it all figured out, don't you?

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.760
Seth's got a little crush.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:48.220
You don't notice how lonely you really are.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.300
This isn't about us.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.960
I'm trying to save you.

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.340
Then do it... save me.

